  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting hydroelectric electricity generation increase in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at 1) reinforcing energy security in South Vietnam to cope with the increase in daily power consumption; and 2) supporting the development of renewable, low-carbon energy, thus contributing to GHG emission reduction.Specific objectives of actions financed through EU funds: 1) Improving Health, Safety and Environment management systems on the hydropower extension construction sites handled by EVN and 2) Maximizing power generation from existing plants by optimizing O&amp;M process</narrative>
  </description>
